  "prefLabel": "Plc 1604.03 Compliance with Legal Reporting Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1604.03 Compliance with Legal Reporting Requirements.\n\n(a) Each registrant that is an entity shall comply with all reporting requirements necessary to maintain good standing status with:\n\n(1) The New Hampshire secretary of state’s office; and\n\n(2) The equivalent authority in the registrant’s state of formation, if other than New Hampshire.\n\n(b) If a registrant fails to maintain good standing in New Hampshire or in the registrant’s state of formation, if other than New Hampshire, the registrant shall:\n\n(1) Notify the licensing bureau within 10 working days; and\n\n(2) Not operate as a nurse agency for compensation in New Hampshire unless and until reobtaining:\n\na. Good standing status in New Hampshire and in the registrant’s state of formation if other than New Hampshire; and\n\nb. Registration under RSA 326-M and Plc 1600.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1600.html"
